# Cloudflare Pages redirect/rewrite rules.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# ⚠️ Do NOT add the classic SPA rule `/*  /index.html  200` here.
#    Combined with the default `html_handling: auto-trailing-slash` it strips
#    `.html`, matches `/*` again and Cloudflare discards the rule as an
#    infinite loop (`wrangler pages dev` prints:
#      "Infinite loop detected in this rule and has been ignored").
#
#    SPA fallback is handled by `assets.not_found_handling: "single-page-application"`
#    in wrangler.jsonc instead — verified working for deep links + refresh.
#
# Add real redirect rules below (first match wins). Keep this file present even
# if empty: it makes `dist/_redirects` exist and future rules a one-liner.

# --- Examples -----------------------------------------------------------------
# /docs/*  https://docs.example.com/:splat  301
# /old     /new                              308
# /api/legacy/*  https://api.example.com/:splat  302
